[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0112","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0112.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-58053","title":"Gitea act_runner 容器逃逸漏洞","description":"Gitea act_runner 的 Docker 后端（受影响版本至 act 0.262.0）在处理工作流容器配置时存在权限管理缺陷，仅强制关闭容器 Privileged 标志，但未过滤 --pid=host、--cap-add 等危险选项。能够在 Docker 后端 runner 上运行工作流的攻击者可利用此问题创建拥有宿主机命名空间和广泛能力的容器，在特权模式被禁用的情况下仍实现容器逃逸并获得宿主机 root 权限。CVSS 评分 9.4，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-58053"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-28T02:16:32.420","updated":"2026-06-30T15:17:00.077","remediation":"立即升级 act_runner 至 0.263.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了容器选项合并时未强制禁用高危 HostConfig 参数的问题。临时缓解措施：在 act_runner 配置中禁止使用 --pid=host、--cap-add、--security-opt 等高危容器选项；为 runner 添加 seccomp 策略限制容器逃逸相关系统调用；仅运行可信工作流，不向不可信用户开放 act_runner 执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/bikini/exploitarium/tree/main/gitea-act-runner-container-options-poc","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/gitea-act-runner-container-hardening-bypass-via-workflow-container-options","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-58053.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58053.json","https://github.com/bikini/exploitarium/blob/cdcbe772ed7ee2a36f2d84a93018f820a32a4a9f/cves.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/CVE/blob/4e96ec5c1f919e7ddf89ce2335ced09b058e2b49/2026.06/CVE-2026-58053%EF%BC%9AGitea%20act_runner%20%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E9%80%83%E9%80%B8%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-06-28/TIER_2_CVE-2026-58053.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a91743cb361cea8aa97e228bbbca0ca0cb04482/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58053.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-58053.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/Gitea_act_runner_%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E9%80%83%E9%80%B8_CVE-2026-58053.toml","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/2853b83f9525211a3c7c25f2ab4e006505d500ad/archive/2026/2026-07-03.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/b7272967d4cf0923f79d101c86e7ecac005fe400/doc/2026-07/%E3%80%90%E9%AB%98%E5%8D%B1%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E9%A2%84%E8%AD%A6%E3%80%91Gitea%20act_runner%20%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E9%80%83%E9%80%B8%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9ECVE-2026-58053.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-58053"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0112.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0112.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0112.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0104","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0104.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54826","title":"SupportCandy WordPress 插件不安全直接对象引用漏洞","description":"WordPress SupportCandy 客服支持插件 3.4.6 及之前版本存在不安全直接对象引用（IDOR）漏洞，CVE 编号 CVE-2026-54826，CWE-639。已认证的订阅者用户可通过篡改请求中的对象标识符参数，越权访问其他用户创建的工单数据，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者无需特殊权限，仅需订阅者账户即可利用，影响大量使用该插件的 WordPress 站点。CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高危。厂商建议升级至 3.4.7 及以上版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54826"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-26T15:16:40.350","updated":"2026-06-29T18:16:37.700","remediation":"立即升级 Jenkins 至 2.516.2 LTS 或 2.518 及以上版本；在防火墙或反向代理层面限制 Jenkins CLI 端口（默认 50000）仅允许可信 IP 访问；启用 Jenkins 审计日志并监控异常 CLI 命令调用及 Groovy 脚本执行记录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://patchstack.com/database/wordpress/plugin/supportcandy/vulnerability/wordpress-supportcandy-plugin-3-4-6-insecure-direct-object-references-idor-vulnerability?_s_id=cve","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54826.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/f2625