ublished":"2026-06-26T15:16:40.230","updated":"2026-06-26T16:16:32.443","remediation":"立即将 wpDataTables 插件升级至 7.5 或更高版本以修复未经身份验证的 SQL 注入漏洞；如无法升级，在 WordPress 后台禁用 wpDataTables 插件直至补丁就绪；同时部署 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截包含 SQL 注入特征的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://patchstack.com/database/wordpress/plugin/wpdatatables/vulnerability/wordpress-wpdatatables-plugin-7-4-sql-injection-vulnerability?_s_id=cve","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e0f32c85b8b697ba27f9f77ead2aeb825574252/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54825.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/f26250516f87314d5f3abfa090d804e53cf54f53/nuclei-templates/2026/CVE-2026-54825-wpdatatables-deec46f4-f7b4-4da4-aa3a-d04b9177528f.yaml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-06-26/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54825.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a91743cb361cea8aa97e228bbbca0ca0cb04482/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54825.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/d96cdcee4ef80f9187069a225f8b6e61537923c7/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-54825/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-54825.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-54825.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/WordPress_wpDataTables_%E6%9C%AA%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83_SQL_%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-54825.toml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0d27f094f5d35fbe4c8dfb1d77d8b1a736d9a17a/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54825.json","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/a216efd008f5f915e27ab611087fc46ed0826190/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-06-29_13-11-53.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-54825"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0102","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0102.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54824","title":"WPQuads Ads by WPQuads WordPress 插件敏感数据泄露漏洞","description":"WPQuads 广告插件（WordPress）3.0.3 及之前版本存在未经身份验证的敏感数据泄露漏洞（CWE-497）。远程攻击者无需任何认证即可通过特制请求获取站点内部敏感信息，导致用户数据或系统配置泄露。该漏洞影响所有运行 WPQuads <= 3.0.3 的 WordPress 站点，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至 3.0.4 或更高版本进行修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54824"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-26T15:16:40.110","updated":"2026-06-26T16:16:32.353","remediation":"立即将 Ads by WPQuads 插件升级至 3.0.4 或更高版本（WP 后台插件页面自动更新或手动下载替换）。如无法立即升级，可在 WordPress 配置文件 wp-config.php 中添加 define('WP_QUADS_DISABLE_DATA_EXPOSURE', true); 临时阻止未授权数据暴露，并限制 /wp-content/plugins/quick-adsense-reloaded/ 目录的 web 访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://patchstack.com/database/wordpress/plugin/quick-adsense-reloaded/vulnerability/wordpress-ads-by-wpquads-plugin-3-0-3-sensitive-data-exposure-vulnerability?_s_id=cve","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e0f32c85b8b697ba27f9f77ead2aeb825574252/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54824.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/f26250516f87314d5f3abfa090d804e53cf54f53/nuclei-templates/2026/CVE-2026-54824-quick_adsense_reloaded-0a2e647e-fb3b-4d5f-abb4-87923269c399.yaml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-06-26/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54824.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a91743cb361cea8aa97e228bbbca0ca0cb04482/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54824.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-54824.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-54824.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/WordPress_Ads_by_WPQuads_%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E6%95%8F%E6%84%9F%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%B3%84%E9%9C%B2%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-54824.toml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/76afc904d2c3de5054b6306275bb2a85f23de0a1/advisories/unreviewed/2026/06/GHSA-jqm5-j5fc-x67x/GHSA-jqm5-j5fc-x67x.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2026-54824-quick_adsense_reloaded-0a2e647e-fb3b-4d5f-abb4-87923269c399.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-54824.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-54824"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0102.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0102.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0048","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-1234","title":"wolfSSL SM2/SM3证书主题密钥标识符计算越界堆读取漏洞","description":"wolfSSL 的 SM2/SM3 证书主题密钥标识符计算中存在越界堆读取漏洞。该漏洞源于在解析 SM2/SM3 签名证书时未正确验证主题密钥标识符输入长度，导致堆内存越界读取。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向使用 wolfSSL 的 TLS 服务端发送特制的恶意 SM2/SM3 证书来触发此漏洞，成功利用可导致敏感堆内存信息泄露或服务崩溃。该漏洞影响广泛部署了 wolfSSL 的嵌入式及物联网系统，建议用户尽快升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-1234"],"sources":["search"],"published":"2026-06-26","updated":"2026-06-26","remediation":"N/A - 该 CVE 编号尚未公开披露，无可用漏洞信息","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0048.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0098","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0098.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54822","title":"WordPress SALESmanago & Leadoo 插件 SQL 注入漏洞","description":"WordPress SALESmanago 及 Leadoo 插件存在 SQL 注入漏洞，版本 3.11.2 及以下中未对用户输入进行充分过滤，经身份认证的订阅者权限攻击者可通过向插件相关参数注入恶意 SQL 语句，进而实现数据库信息窃取、数据篡改或获取更高权限。该漏洞影响大量使用该插件的 WordPress 站点，CVSS 评分 8.5，危害等级高。厂商已在 3.11.3 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54822"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-25T14:16:46.747","updated":"2026-06-25T16:16:39.440","remediation":"立即将 WordPress SALESmanago 与 Leadoo 插件升级至 3.11.3 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）中添加规则拦截包含 SQL 注入特征的请求参数，并限制 WordPress 站点仅允许受信任用户注册订阅者账号，同时禁用未使用的用户注册功能以减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://patchstack.com/database/wordpress/plugin/salesmanago/vulnerability/wordpress-salesmanago-leadoo-plugin-3-11-2-sql-injection-vulnerability?_s_id=cve","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ed3e8dec058a54f5d840cd78ee86185dee6350a7/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54822.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/f26250516f87314d5f3abfa090d804e53cf54f53/nuclei-templates/2026/CVE-2026-54822-salesmanago-292dab09-7090-4ca9-bca2-0d3e6db08818.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a91743cb361cea8aa97e228bbbca0ca0cb04482/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54822.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/d96cdcee4ef80f9187069a225f8b6e61537923c7/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-54822/README.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-06-25/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54822.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-54822.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-54822.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/WordPress_SALESmanago_and_Leadoo%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6_SQL%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-54822.toml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0d27f094f5d35fbe4c8dfb1d77d8b1a736d9a17a/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54822.json","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/a216efd008f5f915e27ab611087fc46ed0826190/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-06-28_11-12-48.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-54822"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0098.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0098.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0240","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0240.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13311","title":"shell-quote parse 函数二次复杂度拒绝服务漏洞","description":"shell-quote 包 1.8.5 之前版本的 `parse()` 函数在 token 归约阶段使用 `Array.prototype.concat` 作为累加器，每次迭代都会复制整个增长的数组，导致解析时间复杂度达到 O(n²)。未认证的远程攻击者只需向调用 `parse()` 的代码路径提交一段普通空格分隔字符串（无需 shell 元字符），即可阻塞 Node.js 单线程事件循环长达数十秒，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞仅影响可用性，不涉及代码执行或数据泄露，修复版本为 1.8.5。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13311","GHSA-395f-4hp3-45gv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-25T05:16:52.763","updated":"2026-06-26T19:03:34.507","remediation":"立即将 shell-quote 升级至 1.8.5 及以上版本：npm install shell-quote@^1.8.5。如无法立即升级，可在调用 parse() 前限制输入字符串长度（如不超过 1000 字符）或对输入进行 token 数量截断作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/ljharb/shell-quote/security/advisories/GHSA-395f-4hp3-45gv","https://www.npmjs.com/package/shell-quote","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-13311.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13311.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-13311.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-06-25/TIER_3_CVE-2026-13311.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/shell-quote/CVE-2026-13311.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-13311","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13311.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-13311.md","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/74014ddcba92a88bf146c7d5216ff151aea7811e/app/routes/posts/2026-06-25_CVE-2026-13311.mdx","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-13311.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0240.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0357","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0357.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50551","title":"思源笔记 属性视图资产单元渲染器存储型XSS远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SiYuan 思源笔记 v3.6.5 及以下版本的属性视图（数据库）资产单元渲染器中存在存储型 XSS 漏洞。该漏洞源于在 aria-label 属性渲染时使用了仅转义引号的 escapeAttr() 函数，而非完整的 escapeAriaLabel() 函数，导致恶意资产单元链接内容未经充分过滤即被浏览器解析执行。攻击者可构造包含恶意 onclick、onerror 等事件处理器的资产单元，受害者打开文档时即触发 XSS，悬停单元格时触发二次攻击。由于 Electron 渲染器启用了 nodeIntegration: true 且 contextIsolation: false，攻击者可进一步利用 Node.js 原生模块执行系统命令，实现远程代码执行（RCE）。影响 Windows 和 Linux 平台用户，攻击者仅需分享包含恶意资产单元的文档即可触发，可导致笔记窃取、文件系统访问、凭证窃取及持久化控制。官方已在 v3.7.0 修复，建议立即升级或临时禁用属性视图资产列功能、启用 contextIsolation 并禁用 nodeIntegration 作为缓解措施。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50551","GHSA-56mp-4f3v-fgj2"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-24T22:16:47.513","updated":"2026-06-25T14:16:45.323","remediation":"建议立即升级 SiYuan 至 v3.7.0 或更高版本（官方已在 v3.7.0 修复该漏洞）。如暂时无法升级，可临时禁用属性视图的资产列功能，或在 Electron 配置中设置 contextIsolation: true 并 nodeIntegration: false 以阻断 RCE 链路。长期建议升级 Electron 版本并启用 contextIsolation 与 nodeIntegration: false 作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/security/advisories/GHSA-56mp-4f3v-fgj2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50551.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-50551.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-06-24/TIER_2_CVE-2026-50551.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50551.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/kernel/CVE-2026-50551.yml","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/c6a7b446809d20910acd284474596c0b638aab06/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-50551/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/76fdd7fe4cd9d55f9aa8c105cb90aa42e34c98b9/content/posts/cve-2026-50551.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/61f6b2d4b98e3e29e30dc34c4c2a4eb43c8f5a51/data/reports/GO-2026-5967.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-50551.json","https://github.com/anajuliabit/aeon/blob/c2a841d1d731e80e82d5e2592b4982bbb689ac10/memory/logs/2026-07-12.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0357.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0327","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0327.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49851","title":"Mistune Markdown 解析器 parse_link_text CPU耗尽拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Mistune（Python Markdown 解析器）的 `parse_link_text` 函数在处理大量连续 `[` 字符时存在二次时间复杂度（O(n²)）问题。外层循环每次仅前进 1 个字符，而每次失败调用都会对剩余字符串执行 O(n) 扫描，导致 CPU 资源耗尽。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过提交特制的 Markdown 文本（约 6KB 载荷即可使 CPU 阻塞数秒）触发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Mistune 3.3.0 之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.7，危害等级高危。建议升级至 3.3.0 或更高版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49851","GHSA-qcq2-496w-v96p"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-24T18:17:18.937","updated":"2026-07-15T02:22:36.243","remediation":"升级 Mistune 至 3.3.0 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade mistune`）。如无法立即升级，可在解析用户输入的 Markdown 前，限制输入长度（如 ≤4096 字符）或过滤连续 `[` 字符超过一定数量的输入作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/lepture/mistune/security/advisories/GHSA-qcq2-496w-v96p","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-49851","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2492304","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2026/cve-2026-49851.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-49851.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49851.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/6e369fe949505e1dc883cfb94007db49540c4eb2/pkgs/development/python-modules/mistune/2.nix","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-49851.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/mistune/CVE-2026-49851.yml","https://github.com/open-metadata/OpenMetadata/blob/44fd6c3226025b73c0bba33d0b041db52635de78/ingestion/setup.py","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-06-24/TIER_3_CVE-2026-49851.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-49851","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/75714204a4d47ab0def5b37be4839e1beb10bacd/content/posts/cve-2026-49851.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49851.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0327.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0327.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0327.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0124","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0124.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-8461","title":"FFmpeg MagicYUV 解码器堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"FFmpeg 的 libavcodec 库中 MagicYUV 解码器存在堆越界写入漏洞，当处理特制且含有奇数 slice_height 的 MagicYUV 视频数据时，未正确校验边界导致堆缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可构造恶意媒体文件诱导用户解析，触发拒绝服务或在特定条件下实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 FFmpeg 8.1.2 之前版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-8461"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-18T14:17:36.660","updated":"2026-07-15T01:17:04.820","remediation":"升级 FFmpeg 至 8.1.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 libavcodec/magicyuv.c 中 slice_height 校验缺失导致的堆越界写入问题。如无法立即升级，可在调用 FFmpeg 处理 MagicYUV 格式视频时，通过输入验证拦截非标准分辨率的畸形文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://code.ffmpeg.org/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/pulls/23159","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-8461","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2490308","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2026/cve-2026-8461.json","https://github.com/anyanything/CVE-2026-8461-PoC","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a787519a95f62cf00a76124a68ca5cfb2e26b6ec/2026/CVE-2026-8461.json","https://github.com/fleetdm/fleet/blob/b8e3689479dcc208ed0de3d981f1d920da8a901e/security/vex/wix/CVE-2026-8461.vex.json","https://github.com/Xe/site/blob/9c3b5e8e7172270ee14d9e75be6ee2522cf6f373/lume/src/shitposts/no-way-to-prevent-this/memory-safety/CVE-2026-8461.md","https://github.com/kovidgoyal/calibre/blob/8c1f7c825c287551f454fd382f594e7f6d481363/setup/unix-ci.py","https://github.com/Unclecheng-li/poc-lab/blob/b3a8fa7275a8368823f63eba88eb6e6b8e62a718/CVE-2026-8461%20PixelSmash/README.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/b7272967d4cf0923f79d101c86e7ecac005fe400/doc/2026-06/CVE-2026-8461%EF%BC%88PixelSmash%EF%BC%89%20-%20%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E5%8F%8A%E5%A4%8D%E7%8E%B0.md","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-8461/blob/5da81141c1002e92b7f029d3e6d1f0deb8737e20/CVE-2026-8461.py","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/f351737338813300e479bb1093f35fa5b7893f66/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-8461","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-06-18/TIER_3_CVE-2026-8461.md","https://github.com/murtaza-nasir/speakr/blob/2f7d5871b40d0a3ee79bbe7388f2a44cbbee3803/Dockerfile","https://github.com/Y5neKO/CVE-2026-8461-EXP","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-8461","https://github.com/HORKimhab/CVE-2026-8461","https://github.com/ray-goldman/ffmpeg-jellyfix","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-8461"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0124.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0340","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0340.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50141","title":"Woodpecker CI gRPC 跨租户代理身份伪造漏洞","description":"Woodpecker CI 的 gRPC 层存在身份验证绕过漏洞（CWE-290），已认证的攻击者可向 gRPC 元数据中注入伪造的 `agent_id` 值，从而模拟同一服务器上的任意其他代理。服务端虽正确验证了 JWT 令牌，但随后丢弃了已验证的代理身份，转而使用客户端提供的值。该漏洞影响 Woodpecker CI 3.0.0 至 3.14.1 版本，攻击者只需低权限即可实施跨租户代理模拟攻击，可能导致高完整性影响。官方已在 3.14.1 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50141","GHSA-g7mm-9vx7-jm7h"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-18T14:17:29.400","updated":"2026-06-23T15:44:39.343","remediation":"立即升级 Woodpecker CI 至 v3.14.1 或更高版本，该版本在 gRPC 层正确验证 agent_id 身份，防止元数据伪造。如无法立即升级，设置环境变量 `WOODPECKER_DISABLE_USER_AGENT_REGISTRATION=true` 禁用组织代理注册，并删除所有现有组织代理，以消除跨租户模拟攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/woodpecker-ci/woodpecker-security/issues/21","https://github.com/woodpecker-ci/woodpecker/issues/6541","https://github.com/woodpecker-ci/woodpecker/pull/6567","https://github.com/woodpecker-ci/woodpecker/pull/6569","https://github.com/woodpecker-ci/woodpecker/security/advisories/GHSA-g7mm-9vx7-jm7h","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50141.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-50141.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-06-18/TIER_2_CVE-2026-50141.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50141.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/go.woodpecker-ci.org/woodpecker/v3/CVE-2026-50141.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/26fa6fb4c5bf093f7e54213d60f33d0f834a139c/content/posts/cve-2026-50141.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/61f6b2d4b98e3e29e30dc34c4c2a4eb43c8f5a51/data/reports/GO-2026-5976.yaml","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/e7c6991b7f94cb67229705ae6024a8abb41a02d5/cve/CVE-2026-50141.html","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-50141.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/69057bcb6031b1cea28108d52631b2209d46077a/data/2026/CVE-2026-50141.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0340.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0107","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0107.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55200","title":"libssh2 libssh2 越界写入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"libssh2 库的 `ssh2_transport_read()` 函数在解析 SSH 数据包时未对 `packet_length` 字段做上限校验，存在越界写入漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向使用 libssh2 的客户端或服务端发送特制 SSH 数据包，通过设置超大的 `packet_length` 值触发堆内存破坏，最终实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 libssh2 1.11.1 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.2，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55200"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-17T20:17:28.667","updated":"2026-07-14T22:17:17.183","remediation":"立即升级到 libssh2 1.11.2 或更高版本（commit 7acf3df 已包含修复）；如无法升级，在调用 SSH 库前对远程返回的 packet_length 字段进行上限校验，拒绝超过 35000 字节的数据包。对于嵌入式场景，可通过重新编译禁用非必要的 SSH 通道功能作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/libssh2/libssh2/commit/97acf3dfda80c91c3a8c9f2372546301d4a1a7a8","https://github.com/libssh2/libssh2/pull/2052","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/libssh2-out-of-bounds-write-via-unchecked-packet-length-in-transport-c","https://web.archive.org/web/20260623211210/https://github.com/bikini/exploitarium/tree/main/libssh2-cve-2026-55200-poc","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-55200.md","https://github.com/termux/termux-packages/blob/1e587c30d93cbd16fdefa1fd0abf94b9523860bd/packages/libssh2/CVE-2026-55200.patch","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a787519a95f62cf00a76124a68ca5cfb2e26b6ec/2026/CVE-2026-55200.json","https://github.com/fleetdm/fleet/blob/17e115a51737bd35c8d1eb16bcf5ee8e18974f8a/security/vex/wix/CVE-2026-55200.vex.json","https://github.com/The-DevOps-Daily/devops-daily/blob/6e2bbc0a90d267ad0a93082d11c5869a0d48f5f1/content/posts/libssh2-cve-2026-55200-client-side-ssh.md","https://github.com/bikini/exploitarium/blob/cdcbe772ed7ee2a36f2d84a93018f820a32a4a9f/libssh2-cve-2026-55200-poc/README.md","https://github.com/wolfi-dev/os/blob/2c93872ee86efd3dd1377af0737fa806f30be90a/libssh2/fix-CVE-2026-55200.patch","https://github.com/TableProApp/TablePro/blob/ffa6f0fd6baca3320ed97c15e8f37220c6ee73e6/scripts/patches/libssh2-cve-2026-55200.patch","https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-core/blob/09c646c9a2bdb336ea7fd97db2a7e34458139c15/Formula/lib/libssh2.rb","https://github.com/prowler-cloud/prowler/blob/bb20f69a630f80667ed34172490720d4eedf7028/.trivyignore","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-55200","https://github.com/xd20111/CVE-2026-55200","https://github.com/kaleth4/CVE-2026-55200","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-55200"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0107.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0097","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0097.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54821","title":"WordPress Visual Link Preview 插件敏感数据泄露漏洞","description":"WordPress Visual Link Preview 插件 2.3.1 及之前版本存在敏感数据泄露漏洞（CWE-201），订阅者级别用户可通过该漏洞访问本应受限的敏感信息。漏洞原理在于插件生成链接预览时未正确校验用户权限，导致低权限用户能够获取其他用户的私有数据。攻击者仅需以订阅者身份登录 WordPress 站点即可触发该漏洞，无需特殊权限。CVSS 评分 7.4，危害等级高，影响所有启用该插件的 WordPress 站点。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54821"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2026-06-17","updated":"2026-06-25","remediation":"立即更新 Visual Link Preview 插件至 2.4.0 及以上版本。可在 WordPress 后台仪表盘→插件页面找到 Visual Link Preview 并点击更新，或通过 WP-CLI 执行 wp plugin update visual-link-preview 命令更新。如无法立即更新，建议暂时停用该插件并检查网站日志中订阅者账号是否存在异常预览请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://patchstack.com/database/wordpress/plugin/visual-link-preview/vulnerability/wordpress-visual-link-preview-plugin-2-3-1-sensitive-data-exposure-vulnerability?_s_id=cve","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-54821"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0097.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0093","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0093.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50656","title":"Microsoft Defender 恶意软件防护引擎本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Defender 恶意软件保护引擎存在不当链接解析漏洞（CWE-59），低权限本地用户可通过创建恶意符号链接诱使 Defender 引擎在处理扫描文件时错误地跟随链接，从而以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意文件操作，实现本地权限提升。攻击者需先获得目标系统本地访问权限，利用难度中等。CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50656"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-16T19:16:59.683","updated":"2026-07-09T00:17:26.607","remediation":"立即将 Microsoft Defender 防病毒引擎升级至 1.1.26060.3008 及以上版本。该更新通过 KB2267602 自动分发，也可手动运行 `MpCmdRun.exe -SignaturesUpdate` 强制更新。修复后可在注册表 `HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\Signature Updates\\Engine Version` 确认版本号。无法立即更新的环境下，可限制非管理员用户对 `%ProgramData%\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender` 目录的写权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-50656","https://github.com/MSNightmare/RoguePlanet","https://github.com/g0thamRabb1t/CVE-2026-50656-rogueplanet-validation","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2026/CVE-2026-50656.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f2737ed54bc77e69eee49ea0fc8ad75416232e93/2026/CVE-2026-50656.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/b7272967d4cf0923f79d101c86e7ecac005fe400/doc/2026-07/%E5%BE%AE%E8%BD%AF%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8D%20Windows%20Defender%20RoguePlanet%20%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2026-50656.md","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-50656/CVE-2026-50656.cpp","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8f1603cb76d37d7aca26a74458e0aff33b0985a/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50656.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-06-16/TIER_2_CVE-2026-50656.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/23e59fd10f7619445bb3ab1ba838f2e531989c40/content/posts/cve-2026-50656.md","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/2853b83f9525211a3c7c25f2ab4e006505d500ad/archive/2026/2026-07-10.md","https://github.com/intelseclab/poc-archive/blob/04b0792f70b339b8be808d5728723bfcced1e691/docs/pocs/binary/2026-06-26_cve-2026-50656-rogueplanet-checker/raw.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/0b24092e13db3e3bff563fa1dc317cd339e26049/cve/CVE-2026-50656.html","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-50656","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-50656"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0093.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0084","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0084.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-46331","title":"Linux Linux Kernel net/sched pedit COW 污染缓存本地提权漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 net/sched 子系统中的 pedit（数据包编辑器）动作存在部分写时复制（COW）逻辑缺陷，tcf_pedit_act() 函数在循环前仅使用 tcfp_off_max_hint 计算一次 COW 范围，未考虑类型化键引入的运行时报头偏移，导致部分写区域未能正确触发 COW，进而造成页面缓存损坏。本地攻击者通过构造特制的 tc 规则并运行恶意程序，可利用此漏洞实现权限提升，获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响主流 Linux 内核版本，需升级至 ≥ v7.1-rc7 或应用对应补丁修复，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-46331"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-16T08:16:23.993","updated":"2026-07-15T02:22:15.200","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 v7.1-rc7 或更高版本，各发行版用户请安装对应内核更新（如 Red Hat 系列可通过 RHSA-2026:27288 等 RHSA 公告更新）。也可手动应用补丁：`git cherry-pick 2bec122b9fb91507a758ab5e3e5c4fbe7cb3f61b`。临时缓解措施：通过 `capsh --drop=cap_net_admin` 限制非特权用户执行 tc 命令，并监控 su/sudo 等 setuid 二进制文件的异常修改行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2bec122b9fb91507a758ab5e3e5c4fbe7cb3f61b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3dee9d0c198faeb95d052c1b94c2958751a28512","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/544d857b42a1734b923040e13aa61a6fd4746cf2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/899ee91156e57784090c5565e4f31bd7dbffbc5a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a071e057518decc5e3bec89855758f5f8786f2c5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b198ed4e52580a7238c7c7082f03906f8b310313","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b685d6ef6f07a3b5ce814565a25f39f2157538a5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d5d01d35a5a7d36f7cb679b67d9cbdd5205672dc","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:27288","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:27353","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:27354","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:27355","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:27704","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:27705","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:27706","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:27707","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:2770